    },
    {
      "id": "6e35a2cc-8391-46a9-81a6-457dacea6964",
      "sessionId": "86835ec5-7b34-4b40-9b03-45a1cf7bafb6",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "glad you are here for me",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T04:56:20.223Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "7baffb19-94f2-448e-9ac8-cc2e358ece4a",
      "sessionId": "86835ec5-7b34-4b40-9b03-45a1cf7bafb6",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "It sounds like you have been carrying quite a heavy load lately. How are you taking care of yourself today?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T04:56:20.530Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c1f7a5d-cc2a-410e-b54e-ca348dc25ab1",
      "sessionId": "86835ec5-7b34-4b40-9b03-45a1cf7bafb6",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "just finished breakfast and have projects to do now",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T04:56:47.702Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "52334d2d-079c-4bcb-a1c8-d6e15a7bf9c0",
      "sessionId": "86835ec5-7b34-4b40-9b03-45a1cf7bafb6",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "I hear you, and it makes complete sense that you'd feel that way. What feels most present for you right now?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T04:56:48.001Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4d91119-7b67-4804-8fd4-4be0d43f60bf",
      "sessionId": "263a273c-3473-4527-9b1a-a692d0581fcd",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Hello! It's so good to see you again. Last time, you mentioned User's name is Charan. How has that been going?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:01:56.908Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "3cc0a02e-98ae-4638-a5c6-0eb57dbca781",
      "sessionId": "263a273c-3473-4527-9b1a-a692d0581fcd",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Hi my name is charan",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:02:17.795Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "45c99b52-3d7b-4fb5-a0ee-26985c90c82b",
      "sessionId": "263a273c-3473-4527-9b1a-a692d0581fcd",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Hi Charan, it is lovely to meet you. I am Suzie, your wellness companion. How are you feeling today?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:02:18.300Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "61363610-1df5-47f3-af34-ec145fb706b9",
      "sessionId": "263a273c-3473-4527-9b1a-a692d0581fcd",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "nothing bad but aniticipating something good today",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:02:49.720Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8727e3e-7030-443f-855e-b9f30fd8ed51",
      "sessionId": "263a273c-3473-4527-9b1a-a692d0581fcd",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "It sounds like you have been carrying quite a heavy load lately. How are you taking care of yourself today?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:02:50.094Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "5389a898-a7e5-4961-b48e-6b56f00aa5fb",
      "sessionId": "902b6006-83ca-4111-9dd3-7eb258580873",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Hello! It's so good to see you again. Last time, you mentioned Charan is anticipating a positive event today.. How has that been going?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:06:37.170Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "53288a0e-fe7d-47f7-9b8e-f0f159acc7ff",
      "sessionId": "902b6006-83ca-4111-9dd3-7eb258580873",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Yeah something good happened today gues what",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:07:14.389Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "201f346c-9c0b-4023-a9f3-f5c2cd979175",
      "sessionId": "902b6006-83ca-4111-9dd3-7eb258580873",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "I am so happy to hear that something good happened! I am curious, what was it?",
