    },
    {
      "id": "ea41ef0a-2121-448c-b62d-81db10a34e42",
      "sessionId": "902b6006-83ca-4111-9dd3-7eb258580873",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "i got o grade in my favroutie subject",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:07:44.733Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "66a97f64-7eb9-4649-96d5-e3cdd28852ec",
      "sessionId": "902b6006-83ca-4111-9dd3-7eb258580873",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "I hear you, and it makes complete sense that you'd feel that way. What feels most present for you right now?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T05:07:45.022Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7680b99-f3bf-4172-9cfb-bd69838ef6e0",
      "sessionId": "4b4772f8-7b14-4aa1-8fae-2fe48c84de82",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Hello! It's so good to see you again. Last time, you mentioned Received an 'O' grade in their favorite subject. How has that been going?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T09:00:36.436Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "f96c84f9-41cc-4335-9165-047aec9ff561",
      "sessionId": "4b4772f8-7b14-4aa1-8fae-2fe48c84de82",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I had a productive day today. I completed most of my work.",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T09:00:53.865Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "be3e4f14-8107-4916-884d-c99fb24f9ef4",
      "sessionId": "4b4772f8-7b14-4aa1-8fae-2fe48c84de82",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "That’s wonderful to hear, Charan. It sounds like you made great progress today. How are you feeling about that?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T09:00:54.333Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "4805f844-aa61-4acb-8115-075824d627ce",
      "sessionId": "4b4772f8-7b14-4aa1-8fae-2fe48c84de82",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "My name is Charan. Please remember this for future chats.",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T09:01:24.151Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed57e54c-6ec8-464b-a484-406fbd3d4873",
      "sessionId": "4b4772f8-7b14-4aa1-8fae-2fe48c84de82",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "I'm glad to know you, Charan. I'll keep that in mind for our future conversations.",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T09:01:24.623Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "2d53df3a-74af-4528-a9cc-ee8c297f3112",
      "sessionId": "4b4772f8-7b14-4aa1-8fae-2fe48c84de82",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "What is my name?",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T09:01:46.127Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "206e5f75-8a0d-450c-a980-9c3bad4a328f",
      "sessionId": "4b4772f8-7b14-4aa1-8fae-2fe48c84de82",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Your name is Charan. I'm glad you asked.",
